  "word_count": 345,
  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u09e65b86\" id=\"u09e65b86\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9929f56e\" id=\"u9929f56e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">泰山派是一款开源的卡片电脑,提供全面开放的软硬件资料,愿与志同道合的的伙伴们共同推动技术的发展和创新。 小巧的板子搭载了高配的处理器、引出丰富的外部资源、多样性SDK、赋予创意无限可能。 软硬件结合、项目式学习、解决项目落地难问题、让每一个想法变成现实。<br /><br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9d8fb810\" id=\"u9d8fb810\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">应用场景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uff247239\" id=\"uff247239\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ucaee0ecf\" id=\"ucaee0ecf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br />1卡片电脑：办公、编程开发，家庭娱乐、编程教育等<br />2Linux服务器：私有云、软路由、NAS、个人WEB服务器等<br />3家庭智能化中枢：电视盒子、智能家居控制、传感器数据分析、安防监控等<br />4工业化：电子广告牌、自动售卖机、机器人、无人机等<br />5嵌入式开发板：加速嵌入式项目验证及开发<br /><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue128ede3\" id=\"ue128ede3\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1706773243148-c802ba9a-2adb-4575-a033-2c07e4663790.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_461%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A461%2C%22originHeight%22%3A523%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23656663%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fl9TU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub5a39cac\" id=\"ub5a39cac\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0e6c666\" id=\"ua0e6c666\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u01a1837a\" id=\"u01a1837a\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Ffiletransfer%2Fimages%3Furl%3Dassets%252F01.png%26sign%3D3bf7085157013b9d10b0aa20076de97d522f4d3a5908de55206086e3b915e969%26date%3D1717661925646%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22nYRdj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf2eeab2b\" id=\"uf2eeab2b\"><span data-lake-id=\"udac91278\" id=\"udac91278\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u62d4f29f\" id=\"u62d4f29f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">硬件参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua529d375\" id=\"ua529d375\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"uf965fa20\" id=\"uf965fa20\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u8298cc07\" id=\"u8298cc07\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">立创泰山派采用 22nm制程 4核 Cortex-A55的64位 CPU </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1a89ce4a\" id=\"u1a89ce4a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">RK3566 </span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9f8542ad\" id=\"u9f8542ad\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">  , 主频高达1.8GHz. 集成 ARM Mali-G52 GPU , 支持 4K 60fps解码， 1080P 60fps 编码， 支持8M ISP 和 HDR， 内置1T ops算力的AI加速器 NPU。 内存提供： 1/2/4/8 GB可选， 存储：EMMC（8/16/32/64/128GB） ，最高支持512GB的TF扩展</span><span data-lake-id=\"u23d41c90\" id=\"u23d41c90\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ud00a92cd\" id=\"ud00a92cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucfc2b8c8\" id=\"ucfc2b8c8\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1706773268216-ca1ca621-8fef-40b2-b1a5-e87d4e54c9d5.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_639%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A639%2C%22originHeight%22%3A482%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b7a792%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AYAli%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua1836e5d\" id=\"ua1836e5d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a6af995\" id=\"u2a6af995\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufc7c9ec4\" id=\"ufc7c9ec4\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fjpeg%2F27903758%2F1706773277418-0e69f71b-b1db-4181-b525-70a5afec0aa7.jpeg%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_759%252Climit_0%252Finterlace%252C1%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A759%2C%22originHeight%22%3A942%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cZlsN%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p>",
